{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0004_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_05_1000_p", "source_sha256": "b460ced5f0fc0cee667860ee16a8651b698108e29a2d9191c6876978e0d16745", "ja": "おーい、志保！", "zh": "喂──志保！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0004_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_05_1001_033sih", "source_sha256": "9dc80adf74db85281574798867d5d7b78f0b2d77833d6550d4ea54c6473ddcbb", "ja": "……？　{$P$}さん？", "zh": "……？{$P$}先生？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0004_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_05_1002_p", "source_sha256": "f0c4fd78540a72f9962d53b92969211ce1a50fd8dc0c0c146404dd58cfdfc8ed", "ja": "よかった、追いついた。\n志保、ちょっと話をさせてもらえないか？", "zh": "太好了，追上你了。\n志保，能不能和你谈谈呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0004_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_05_1003_033sih", "source_sha256": "3f6c6ff9cec06ef0ba347289459451d0a43d1dd3476ae882355c295f373b392a", "ja": "すみません、急いでますから。", "zh": "不好意思，我在赶时间。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0004_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_05_1004_p", "source_sha256": "6c92137f7753e156b5fb1215ac3b53dff51bad9802242fb92582a4010aea57d9", "ja": "じゃあ、一緒に歩きながらでいいかな。\n邪魔はしないから。", "zh": "那我和你一起边走边讲就好了，\n我不会妨碍你的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0004_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_05_1005_033sih", "source_sha256": "9f250d35f052b9a929f97f142ea20e73d8beaed0e22bee326bfeb7f9c690ab7c", "ja": "……まあ、そこまで言うなら。", "zh": "……好吧，既然你都说到这个地步了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0004_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_05_1006_p", "source_sha256": "fc1d4062228c74229d251848f68127b97256cc075305c5e2a683afdb722476eb", "ja": "ありがとう。\nところで、行き先を聞いてもいいか？", "zh": "谢谢。\n话说回来，可以问你要去哪里吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0004_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_05_1007_033sih", "source_sha256": "67ac879481831dda258637c97f85cd49a40ebdde6d536fa8188244378bb57188", "ja": "……保育園です。", "zh": "……幼儿园。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0004_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_05_1009_p", "source_sha256": "1ff41714c18a4e7521dc43bdf31b28ce3d7fa5d748097384180af83699b81e7e", "ja": "そうだったのか……\n保育園に、弟さんを迎えに……。", "zh": "原来是这样啊……\n你要去幼儿园接弟弟回家……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0004_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_05_1010_033sih", "source_sha256": "e8fe4d15dcee7c0bb5a78b3346a30395c0903288d6e222406238a2c5be184804", "ja": "はい。母の仕事が忙しくて……\nそれで私が、代わりに迎えにいってるんです。", "zh": "是的，家母工作很忙……\n所以我会代替她去接弟弟。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0004_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_05_1011_p", "source_sha256": "ad092d37d645647d5c3dfcad9937650adb1a7b7a3f61b584240a20dc4bb31835", "ja": "だからレッスンが終わると、\n毎回急いで帰ってたんだな。", "zh": "所以课程结束后，\n你才总是急急忙忙地回去啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0004_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_05_1012_p", "source_sha256": "6ee3af23c18af9da67afd369b583327094cc96a97bcc5e077226afe91c681953", "ja": "それなら、練習を時間どおりに終わらせるって\n方針自体は、良かったんじゃないか？", "zh": "那么依照预计时间结束练习的方针\n本身不是很好吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0004_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_05_1013_033sih", "source_sha256": "7c31925a8f6899f6a68bcd6864b4a32e1186ef088e2ccda8b93ca5c706351652", "ja": "時間が限られているから、\n1秒もムダにできないと思ってただけです。", "zh": "我只是觉得时间有限，\n一秒都不能浪费而已。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0004_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_05_1014_033sih", "source_sha256": "dbbccea1e82acc3999ff2307310f1583e402ebc9588f1c67f1336dcd2786be5f", "ja": "決まった時間の分だけレッスンルームで過ごせば、\n練習したことになるとは思えませんし。", "zh": "我并不觉得只是在练习室中度过预定的\n练习时间，就等于完成了练习。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0004_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_05_1015_p", "source_sha256": "a12a14c3b74a29f01e48620da96eb673322eec025ea5eedb94831f1a090b6cb9", "ja": "もちろん、そんなこと思ってないよ。", "zh": "我当然也没这么想喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0004_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_05_1016_033sih", "source_sha256": "7b429f4324d7068c991d4f8816489b81008314979af5c9704a909f97bdf25d55", "ja": "そうでしょうか？　他の人達は、\nサークル活動か何かのつもりみたいに見えます。", "zh": "是吗？我看其他人\n就像是在参加社团活动一样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0004_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_05_1017_033sih", "source_sha256": "970134d2e7e2baa64435ef38ed86f8286b5e6396b2708619cc5a8d9413f55594", "ja": "今日なんて、いきなりみんなで遊ぶ話なんてして。\n親睦を深めるとか、言ってましたけど……。", "zh": "今天也是，突然说要大家一起玩，\n说要加深大家的感情……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0004_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_05_1018_033sih", "source_sha256": "26af0ca47704c5367e4b4365eb5dc3893e77c4460ee39a7da5267dad82d677a1", "ja": "私は、仕事でアイドルをやってるんです。遊びで\nアイドルをしてる人達とは、一緒にやっていけません。", "zh": "我是把偶像当作工作，没办法跟\n把当偶像视为玩乐的人合作。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0004_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_05_1019_p", "source_sha256": "5287f81ba87a2fde540a5709c29d8b24243ff49eb5b901df48a1f3ce608de18d", "ja": "そうか……志保はみんなが、\n本気じゃないように見えたんだな。", "zh": "这样啊……在志保看来，\n大家并不是认真的呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0004_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_05_1020_033sih", "source_sha256": "935532857f4437f91a141cbcd0684305ed6f67ba3c2a252a1afcdafe6b9c25ed", "ja": "違うんですか？　遊ぶことばかり考えてたり、\nレッスンを早く終わらせたがったり。", "zh": "难道不对吗？她们总是想着玩乐，\n想要早点结束课程。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0004_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_05_1021_033sih", "source_sha256": "6409fb57f68353f4dbf1968d00ab06e34c561eab0c083f65b202fc0d9cf00a27", "ja": "とても、本気で取り組んでいるようには\n見えませんけど。", "zh": "怎么看也不像是\n全心全意在努力。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0004_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_05_1022_p", "source_sha256": "d789127a269bfa73688a0fc1c6ba4ec653bb5c606ded592c4ff5ba8cb484f2f4", "ja": "アイドルへの取り組み方は、人それぞれだよ。\n何より、結果がものを言う世界だ。", "zh": "对于偶像这一行，每个人的努力方式都各有不同喔，\n而且这个业界特别重视结果。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0004_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_05_1023_033sih", "source_sha256": "ee53778d51620b4ee037b92ef48e8e753293f61b58d62c23167f29e4a245a6a4", "ja": "……そうですね。でも私は、レッスンをしなくちゃ。\n人より練習しないと、結果が出せないんです。", "zh": "……也是呢，但我必须训练，\n一定要比别人更努力，才能练出成果。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0004_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_05_1024_033sih", "source_sha256": "a3367afc9e955709bd0e79bfb82eae344223001001f3987933ac60d02c8be8fa", "ja": "結果を出さないと……。\n私は、アイドルになった意味がないのに。", "zh": "要拿出成果才行……\n不然我当偶像就失去意义了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0004_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_05_1025_p", "source_sha256": "7693cb986ea65f8da66ba5626af690c9ac8e25165e83fd0364fa2ef71c347caa", "ja": "志保……。", "zh": "志保……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0004_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_05_1026_033sih", "source_sha256": "d5fef8fd528934b876dd0a57859628e4897e4d6e567cd0d1aa28167fb831e74e", "ja": "静香だって……リーダーなのに、\n自分で言ったことを、全然……。", "zh": "静香也是……身为队长，\n对自己说过的话却完全……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0004_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_05_1027_033sih", "source_sha256": "5b74d3c8f09cc199982c30925be68df3e98ec82d5ca50c35cc52c8eb1a7cc484", "ja": "ああ、そうですね。{$P$}さんの\nいう通り、人それぞれなのかも。", "zh": "是啊，没错呢。也许就像{$P$}先生\n说的一样，每个人有自己的方式。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0004_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_05_1028_033sih", "source_sha256": "684e3a577f1a21b5717676e9c6c7c52cf39c1e40b1397e1d34877129bfae428d", "ja": "私は私なりに頑張りますから。みんなはみんなで、\n親睦でもなんでも深めればいいんじゃないですか。", "zh": "我会做出我最大的努力。\n大家要加深感情或什么的，就自己去吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0004_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_05_1029_p", "source_sha256": "fe502f9ffe7b83a921cdb5b24e12278452d046058adc3e3f6f56b5ffc8d7e69b", "ja": "いや、志保がいないと意味がないんだ。\n実は……。", "zh": "不，要是志保不在就没意义了，\n其实……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0004_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_05_1030_033sih", "source_sha256": "5bef2cfeec82ef03a5359b0c73b834be656e901eaf929490328982d1b5cc7654", "ja": "星梨花に門限が……。\nそれで、朝練を……。", "zh": "星梨花有门禁……\n所以开始晨练……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0004_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_05_1031_p", "source_sha256": "57eab4e475f51b18235c3e1577c6697f73334f0a3962ebf9f37975dd05b8877d", "ja": "静香が、麗花達の提案に乗り気だったのも、\nそういった事情を踏まえてなんだと思う。", "zh": "我想静香对丽花她们的提案有兴趣，\n也是因为这些缘故。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0004_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_05_1032_p", "source_sha256": "34b766d2f0584ae637303050f792a5abb5afe015e6d5a0c368e699f970976614", "ja": "親睦会で、お互いへの理解を深めることで、\nより良いステージになると考えたんじゃないかな。", "zh": "透过亲睦派对加深彼此之间的理解，\n就能成就更好的表演，她们是这样想的吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0004_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_05_1033_033sih", "source_sha256": "ebeeb52153349ec98c5aeb4b859ac6946ab18288536b483497f1fa21cc3d2450", "ja": "はぁ……。\n確かに、静香の考えそうなことですね。", "zh": "嗯……\n这的确很像静香会想的事呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0004_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_05_1034_033sih", "source_sha256": "cb088e9976ba4a1bf117c92138ddc7723f2afa6fe395729f4aee0bc544dfbbfb", "ja": "練習時間がないって、知ってるのに。\nチームワークのために、茜さん達の提案を……。", "zh": "明明知道练习时间不够，\n却为了团队合作而同意茜她们的提案……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0004_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_05_1035_p", "source_sha256": "2025b88f1f2180ba7968c51d3df00a59cc4f93816a7f73f97b7ffd4c4feeb2d2", "ja": "みんな、クレシェンドブルーのことを考えてたんだよ。\n志保と同じように。", "zh": "大家都是为了「Crescendo Blue」着想，\n和志保一样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0004_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_05_1037_033sih", "source_sha256": "e6847f4b1c11bad97b53503aa89dc9060837a55702a48a46392f65f6c630a581", "ja": "私とは、違うと思いますけど。\n私は……。", "zh": "我认为和我不一样，\n因为我……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0004_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_05_1038_033sih", "source_sha256": "1783c5723da8f0d2e04dc8950e27d10fa2fad840dda0783d87e6df7460a6e23a", "ja": "自分のことしか、考えてませんでしたから。", "zh": "我只有想到自己。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0004_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_05_1039_p", "source_sha256": "b842c5d3eefa50a19c2b6bc7ff9aa80a5b5f717022cbe2e38bd04d6f8a1ba528", "ja": "志保……。\nでも、当たり前だと思うけどな？", "zh": "志保……\n但我觉得这是理所当然的啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0004_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_05_1040_033sih", "source_sha256": "61842fb2adf337d70965cde3013ac335b250f3af06f6d97646c4fb4ee2c0c7ca", "ja": "え？　何を言ってるんですか？", "zh": "咦？你在说什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0004_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_05_1041_p", "source_sha256": "d40cc66477c66b50a30bd6d22d99e7aea85dd8d841d01d64a3ed78e9c384ed88", "ja": "みんな、自分の大事にしたいものを好き勝手に、\n大事にしてるだけだよ。", "zh": "大家都只是自顾自地珍惜\n自己所重视的事物而已喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0004_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_05_1042_p", "source_sha256": "df2d02839e81c294d0466696370a74d9979e0a784417dadcfd0c4d172b38a1fb", "ja": "麗花は、みんなで仲良く頑張りたかったんだろうし、\n茜はとことん、楽しみたかったんだろう。", "zh": "丽花应该是想和大家打好关系、一起加油，\n茜则是想玩个痛快吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0004_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_05_1043_p", "source_sha256": "35e96887fbeae065a93046dba871e064ce2c061855f2438be0246df73ed98487", "ja": "星梨花は周りに迷惑をかけたくなかったんだろうし、\n志保は、真面目に練習したかったんだろ？", "zh": "星梨花不想为身边的人造成麻烦，\n志保你是想要认真练习吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0004_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_05_1044_033sih", "source_sha256": "209197354e9ae668c782a62dd6f4c7e59eeb0c5ddab41e9ddf3b2c0116eaa793", "ja": "は、はい……。", "zh": "是、是的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0004_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_05_1045_p", "source_sha256": "2ffb7ddfff68126d79538690da17bd39842c131ca5d7eb7f6f8cd3b679e34f4d", "ja": "静香はリーダーとして、そういうみんなの気持ちを、\nひとつひとつ、大事にしたかったんだろうな。", "zh": "静香身为队长，应该是想好好重视\n每个人各自的心情吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0004_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_05_1047_033sih", "source_sha256": "fa9bb3e4285608d5357ded6738acd664218e88ab2af07bba6676ebb8bd4c7e6f", "ja": "そういうことなら、言ってくれればいいのに。", "zh": "如果是这样的话，跟我说一声就好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0004_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_05_1048_p", "source_sha256": "1dab7b91e7d10fb7f9ba2bf045ff43fe6878b9bb5899a7d1b20e2d0102f443ad", "ja": "そう言うなって。家の事情とか、\n仲間には言いにくいじゃないか。", "zh": "别这么说嘛，家里的状况\n应该也很难跟伙伴说出口吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0004_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_05_1049_033sih", "source_sha256": "f3fae8b127aac6d8f29807051a1b2eb96e92e56a7f92b0c7d62dfaf0fa7d4a40", "ja": "まあ……。言う必要があることと、\nないことがあると思いますけど。", "zh": "嗯……我想有些是必须说出来的，\n也有些是不用说的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0004_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_05_1050_p", "source_sha256": "caee3fa25b56a50399d541285b87fc21d1a97baec582bb771ca2ac96ee20154b", "ja": "はは、それもそうか。\nまあ、言って困ることも無いと思うけどな。", "zh": "哈哈，是没错。\n不过我想说了也不会有什么麻烦就是了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0004_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_05_1052_p", "source_sha256": "08dd6db7128948a020e900fc531760fe73b71b94445579df34ab091c35e10f93", "ja": "と、そういうわけで……、志保。\nユニットに戻ってくれないか？", "zh": "所以，就是这么回事……志保，\n你愿意回到团体吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0004_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_05_1053_033sih", "source_sha256": "086c12fd18ea31100404c73fcb28260c0ca05f05952cb0d126d418424cb3ffcf", "ja": "……いいんですか？\n今さら……。", "zh": "……可以吗？\n事到如今……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0004_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_05_1055_p", "source_sha256": "adc7a3f2d951284628760de7783352d513fd54693144575b3c7f1abd5334f8a9", "ja": "大丈夫だよ。\nみんな、志保を待ってるから。", "zh": "没问题的，\n大家都在等着志保。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0004_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_05_1056_033sih", "source_sha256": "4c22ac5dccb24f8bd39b900ff65b0f9c646a694a8f86e166155ae89060fff55d", "ja": "……っ。わ、わかりました。\n明日、話してみます。静香や、みんなと……。", "zh": "……我、我知道了。\n明天我会和静香还有大家谈谈看的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0004_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_05_1057_p", "source_sha256": "af59ae90def5d706eeddcdbb883c4fdbbf50af157bcd7cc68ee544dd85ce1771", "ja": "（志保の、ユニットに対する熱意……この想いが\n伝われば、みんなは最高のステージに立てるだろう）", "zh": "（志保对这个团体的热情……如果这份心意\n能传递出去，大家就能展现出最棒的表演吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0004_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_05_title", "source_sha256": "7e0fd96223298a8c944535b2f063413ed84d3c5e2045efca4e8dda79fe4dd47b", "ja": "それぞれの夢を刻むため", "zh": "为了刻画各自的梦想", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0004_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_05_synopsis", "source_sha256": "f22025db0c824f1807d754fbffd94804f9e6cf92367ed1cb7a5be525d53011cf", "ja": "志保に追いついたプロデューサーは、4人の\nメンバーそれぞれの事情や想いについて志保\nと話す。自分の想いだけに囚われていたこと\nを反省した志保は、プロデューサーに後押し\nされ、改めてメンバーと話すことを決める。", "zh": "追上志保的制作人，将其他四名成员的情况和\n想法都告诉了志保。志保过去一直受制于自己\n的想法，为此她深深反省。在受到制作人的鼓\n励后，她决定与成员们重新谈过。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
